<title>UK: My Kinda Town says received bid approach.</title>
<headline>My Kinda Town says received bid approach.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>My Kinda Town Plc said it had received an approach which might lead to an offer for the company.</p>
<p>In a statement, it said such an offer, if made, &quot;is unlikely to be at a signficant premium to the current share price.&quot;</p>
<p>At 1400 GMT the firm's shares were quoted at 180 pence, up 6-1/2p from yesterday's close.  </p>
<p>My Kinda Town, which operates restaurant chains, said it was consulting with its financial advisers, Close Brothers.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
